{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2022-05-10 09:00:00', 'title': 'DOSIS ANNOUNCES NATIONWIDE PRECISION DOSING IMPLEMENTATION WITH DAVITA', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--DOSIS, A MARKET LEADER IN ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE-POWERED PRECISION DOSING, ANNOUNCED TODAY THE IMPLEMENTATION OF ITS FLAGSHIP PERSONALIZED DOSING PRODUCT AT DAVITA (NYSE: DVA) CLINICS NATIONWIDE. DOSIS'S SMART ANEMIA MANAGER (SAM) PERSONALIZES DRUG DOSING FOR ERYTHROPOIESIS-STIMULATING AGENTS (ESAS), A CLASS OF DRUGS USED TO TREAT END-STAGE RENAL DISEASE PATIENTS WITH CHRONIC ANEMIA. INTEGRATION OF DOSIS'S PERSONALIZED DOSING RECOMMENDATIONS INTO DAVITA'S ANEMIA"}{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2022-05-10 06:02:00', 'title': 'DAVITA HONORS EXTRAORDINARY NURSES WITH DAISY AWARDS', 'text': 'RECOGNIZES NURSES WHO MAKE AN EXCEPTIONAL DIFFERENCE IN CARE DELIVERY. DENVER , MAY 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DAVITA \xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 56 OF ITS NEPHROLOGY NURSES WERE HONORED WITH THE DAISY AWARD® FOR EXTRAORDINARY NURSES\xa0DURING NATIONAL NURSES WEEK.'}